The '''snowy-wind''' repository is a project created with '''CodeSandbox''', a popular online code editor and development environment. This repository serves as a foundation for further development and experimentation. The following article provides an overview of the repository, its features, and installation instructions.

== Overview ==
The '''snowy-wind''' repository is an open-source project that was initialized using '''CodeSandbox'''. As a starting point for new projects, it provides a basic structure and configuration that can be built upon. The repository's primary purpose is to facilitate rapid development and prototyping of web applications.

=== Features ===
The '''snowy-wind''' repository includes the following key features:
* A basic project structure, set up for immediate use
* Configuration files for '''CodeSandbox''', enabling seamless integration and development
* A starting point for building custom web applications

== Installation ==
To get started with the '''snowy-wind''' repository, follow these steps:
# Create a copy of the repository using [GitHub] or by forking it directly on [GitHub]
# Set up your development environment, ensuring you have the necessary dependencies installed
# Open the project in '''CodeSandbox''' or your preferred code editor to begin development

